    "name": "Wrap & Bowl Kuch",
    "tagline": "Made with passion, served with love.",
    "story": "Fresh salad bowls and satisfying Wanpaku sandwiches from a home kitchen in Kuching, Sarawak. Thoughtfully prepared to make good food a convenient part of your busy day.",
    "founder_name": "Ayu Shafinaz",
    "founder_intro": "Hi, I’m Ayu Shafinaz, founder of Wrap & Bowl Kuch, a small home-based food business in Kuching, Sarawak. A love for cooking became a way to share good food and earn extra income.",
    "founding_story": "My journey began with something simple — my love for cooking. What started as a hobby slowly turned into an opportunity to earn extra income while doing something I genuinely enjoy. I never imagined that something I loved doing in my free time could grow into a little business of my own.\nFor me, food is more than just something we eat. It brings comfort, happiness and a little joy to our everyday lives.\nRunning a small business comes with its own challenges, but every step of this journey has taught me something valuable. What started as a side income has grown into something close to my heart — a little dream that I’m slowly building with passion, patience and a lot of love.\nWith love and gratitude,\nAyu Shafinaz",
    "food_philosophy": "Through Wrap & Bowl Kuch, I hope to share the joy of good food with delicious, convenient meals that make healthier eating easier and more enjoyable. Our meals are thoughtfully prepared for people balancing busy daily routines.",
    "signature_food": "Fresh Salad Bowls, Wanpaku Sandwiches and Monday Sukiya Beef Rice Bowls",
